# Commands run by the launchd job com.redwood.demo (see com.redwood.demo.plist).
# The everyday cases for frame pacing (boot-arg touch_lat=1; tools/frames.py): unlock, then home-screen
# page swipes both ways, Search pulled down and closed, Control Center from the top right corner and
# closed, Settings opened (the zoom), its list flung down and up, and closed with the home gesture (the
# zoom back); all of it twice over.
#
# Why the long heartbeat first: the loader keeps only the start and the end of the kernel's log
# (mtkloader's save_log: a quarter of the room from the head, the rest from the tail, everything between
# thrown away), and the system says about 6 KB a second, so on lancelot the middle of a 250 s run -- a
# megabyte of it -- never reaches the host. Everything this list did between 14 s and 199 s of
# logs/lancelot-glfps10.log was in that hole, and the hole looked like a hanging machine. So the work
# goes where the log is kept: the last sixty-odd seconds. The heartbeat says the CPU's counter every
# 10 s while the wait lasts, which tells a program that is waiting from one that is stuck -- and says
# where, if the machine is not the same by then as it was at the start.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch heartbeat 165 10
/redwood/bin/rwtouch button home wait 4 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 4
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 2 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 2 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 2 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 3
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.5 0.4 0.5 0.7 300 wait 3 button home wait 3 swipe 0.92 0.003 0.92 0.5 300 wait 3 button home wait 3
/redwood/bin/rwtouch tap 0.615 0.71 wait 3 swipe 0.5 0.8 0.5 0.3 150 wait 3 swipe 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.8 150 wait 3 swipe 0.5 0.995 0.5 0.55 150 wait 3
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 2 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 2 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 2 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 3
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.5 0.4 0.5 0.7 300 wait 3 button home wait 3 swipe 0.92 0.003 0.92 0.5 300 wait 3 button home wait 3
/redwood/bin/rwtouch tap 0.615 0.71 wait 3 swipe 0.5 0.8 0.5 0.3 150 wait 3 swipe 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.8 150 wait 3 swipe 0.5 0.995 0.5 0.55 150 wait 3